.SH "SDL SPECIFIC OPTIONS"
.PP
\fB+sdl\-allow\-screensaver\fR
.RS 4
Allow local screensaver to activate (default: off)
.RE
.PP
\fB\-sdl\-connection\-dialog\fR
.RS 4
Show the connection dialog with progress and errors (default: on). Overrides \fISDL_ConnectionDialog\fR from the configuration file unless \fIallowCommandlineToOverride\fR is disabled.
.RE
.PP
\fB/sdl\-max\-fps\fR:\fIfps\fR
.RS 4
Draw at most \fIfps\fR screen updates per second (1\-1000). Only local drawing is limited: input and window events are still handled immediately, network bandwidth and server load are unchanged (see \fB/frame\-ack\fR). 0 disables the limit (default: 0)
.RE
.
